{"items":[{"topic":"t4","k":"1 / Dúzilisi","slide":{"k":"1 / Dúzilisi","h":"Yapon shamı degenimiz ne?","b":"<p>Hár sham belgili waqıt (mısalı 1 saat) ishindegi bahanı kórsetedi: <b>Open</b> (ashılıw), <b>Close</b> (jabılıw), <b>High</b> (eń joqarı) hám <b>Low</b> (eń tómen).</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 200\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"123\" y=\"70\" width=\"34\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#27c485\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"380\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#ef5a5a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"363\" y=\"70\" width=\"34\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"start\">High</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"start\">Close</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"start\">Open</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"start\">Low</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ósiwshi sham</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Túsiwshi sham</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"start\">Open</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"start\">Close</text></svg><p><b>Denesi</b> — Open hám Close arasındaǵı bólek. <b>Kólegeler (kúlkiqlar)</b> — denesinen joqarı hám tómen sızıqlar.</p><p><b>Sham qalay payda boladı?</b> Bir saat dawamında baha ózgerip turadı. Saat aqırında sol qozǵalıs bir shamǵa jıynaladı:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 200\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"30,140 80,160 120,165 170,120 210,100 250,45 290,80 330,70\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.9s\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"140\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Open</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.2s\"><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"165\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Low</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.5s\"><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"45\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">High</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.8s\"><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"70\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Close</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2.1s\"><text x=\"385\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">➜</text></g><line class=\"gy\" style=\"animation-delay:2.3s\" x1=\"450\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect class=\"gy\" style=\"animation-delay:2.3s\" x=\"433\" y=\"70\" width=\"34\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#27c485\" rx=\"2\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2.8s\"><text x=\"450\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1 sham</text></g></svg><ul class=\"pts\"><li><b>Ósiwshi sham</b> (jasıl): Close &gt; Open, baha ósken</li><li><b>Túsiwshi sham</b> (qızıl): Close &lt; Open, baha túsken</li></ul>"}}]}